### Audiophile payment slice — click "Send request" above each block (Visual Studio or VS Code REST Client).
### Send 2 first: requests 3 and 7–10 read the order id from its response.
@base = http://localhost:5040
# XX59 Headphones (4,499 EGP). Swap for any id returned by request 1.
@productId = 4ae5911a-421b-4565-b75f-53809c3da182


### 1. Catalogue
# @name catalogue
GET {{base}}/products

### 2. Card order → response.payment.checkoutUrl opens Fawaterak's hosted page
#    A new Idempotency-Key is generated on every send, so each send creates a new order.
#    Test card (always succeeds): 5123450000000008 · "Fawaterak test" · 12/26 · CVV 100
#    Test card (always fails):    4222 0000 0672 4235 · 12/26 · CVV 123
# @name cardOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: card-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Card",
  "shipping": {
    "fullName": "Mona Hassan",
    "phone": "+201000000000",
    "street": "12 Tahrir Street",
    "city": "Cairo",
    "country": "Egypt",
    "postalCode": null
  }
}

### 3. Resend with the SAME Idempotency-Key as request 2 → 200, same order, no second invoice
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{cardOrder.request.headers.Idempotency-Key}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Card",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 4. Fawry / cash outlet ("Kiosk") → the hosted page shows the code to pay in cash
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: fawry-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Kiosk",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 5. Cash on delivery — confirmed immediately, no gateway
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: cod-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "CashOnDelivery",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 6. My orders
GET {{base}}/orders

### 7. The card order from request 2 — watch Pending → Confirmed after you pay
GET {{base}}/orders/{{cardOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Webhook missed? Ask Fawaterak directly (getInvoiceData)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{cardOrder.response.body.$.id}}/payment/sync

### 9. What the gateway told us about this order (audit trail)
GET {{base}}/orders/{{cardOrder.response.body.$.id}}/payment/events

### 10. A forged webhook is rejected with 401
POST {{base}}/payments/fawaterak/webhook_json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hashKey": "forged", "invoice_id": 1, "invoice_key": "x", "payment_method": "Card", "invoice_status": "paid" }
